  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.3: Swap source and target, Move (copy then remove from the source), Remove from the source with Add back, filter chips (Not in target, In both, Only in target, Last 7 days, Modified by me), a comparison export, Modified since by person, a Solutions column listing where each component is used, Check target for missing dependencies, export of all results, and a tidier command bar. Model-driven app warnings now follow Include required. 1.0.2: A search box, sortable Modified columns, markers for components already in the target, a required-components preview, a per-table subcomponent choice, batched copy with progress and Cancel, Publish all, New solution, a yellow note on tables added completely with a confirmation before copying them or model-driven apps, corrected component type numbers, canvas apps and flows grouped by kind, solutions listed newest first, and faster loading. 1.0.1: Author name updated. 1.0.0: First release. Copy components between solutions (with or without required components), paged solution and component loading, readable names for custom component types, and export of failed copies to CSV.",
